# octet native runtime for __TARGET__

This package contains the exact-version native `octet` and `octet-host` binaries
for **__TARGET__**, together with octet's packaged `README.md`, `docs/`,
`examples/`, and `sdk/` resources under `share/octet/`.

These scoped names are source packaging identities, not proof of registry rights
or availability. Use the installation command only after an authorized release
has published the packages.

It is an implementation package selected by `@skaft/octet`. Install the
public launcher rather than selecting a platform package by hand. This package
has no dependencies or lifecycle scripts and its binaries never resolve or
download another package at runtime:

```sh
npm install --global --ignore-scripts --no-audit --no-fund @skaft/octet@VERSION
```
